    "prompt": "Archaeologists use repeated ceramic styles as evidence for a regional trade connection. A newer comparison shows that the styles could have spread through several exchange networks rather than one central route. The second observation narrows the conclusion that could reasonably be drawn from the first. The passage uses the term to connect the immediate detail with the qualification that follows it. The word is used to characterize what happens when the relevant condition changes. The context makes the term’s meaning specific to the pattern being described rather than to the topic in general.\n\nIn this context, the word “mediate” most nearly means which of the following?",
