    "prompt": "A cooperative changes its purchasing policy after regional prices become less predictable. The change reduces exposure to short-term price swings, but members with different production schedules benefit by different amounts. The contrast between the two observations reveals why the initial evidence alone is insufficient. Here, the word helps characterize a conditional result rather than an unconditional claim. Here, the word describes the role of the feature in the author’s explanation. The context makes the term’s meaning specific to the pattern being described rather than to the topic in general.\n\nIn this context, the word “reinforce” most nearly means which of the following?",
